     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>關於資料補遺漏值的部分，</div>我查到這個Function : mice (Multivariate Imputation by Chained Equations)<div><br></div><div><div>Description</div><div><br></div><div>Generates Multivariate Imputations by Chained Equations (MICE)</div></div><div>雖然 Help 可以查到相關描述，</div><div>但還是有些地方不懂</div><div>df 是 1005 * 81 的dataframe</div><div><div>df.after.imputation &lt;- mice(df, m = 5)</div><div><br></div><div>error message :</div><div> iter imp variable</div><div>  1   1  X4300.CNVR1310.SWR5_EXT.EDC</div><div>Error in solve.default(xtx + diag(pen)) : </div><div>  system is computationally singular: reciprocal condition number = 4.60107e-28</div></div><div><br></div><div>或是說有其他的方法可以將遺漏值直接補上整個column的平均值?<br>因為1005筆資料 ，大部分是缺一個 或四個值。</div><div><br></div><div>先謝謝各位神人了~</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "RT0F-2lhBAAJ",
   "from": "WEPA ^_^",
   "author": "d42e88b7645d03c8",
