    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Tsai,<div><br></div><div>請參考以下程式碼與附圖結果, 主要採用 apply 或 lapply函數.</div><div><br></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b># title : fill missing value with column mean</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b># date  : 2015.10.16</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b>(df &lt;- data.frame(x1=c(1,2,NA,3,4),</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b>                  x2=c(10,20,30,40,NA),</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b>                  x3=c(100,200,NA,300,400)))</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b># method 1</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b>df.apply &lt;- apply(df, 2, function(x) {</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b>  x[<a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238170914000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2dQi1KmxrxFHBTqSp43uh5\">is.na</a>(x)] &lt;- mean(x, na.rm=TRUE)</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b>  x})</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b>df.apply</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b># meyhod 2</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b>df.lapply &lt;- data.frame(lapply(df, function(x) {</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b>  x[<a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238170914000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2dQi1KmxrxFHBTqSp43uh5\">is.na</a>(x)] &lt;- mean(x, na.rm=TRUE)</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b>  x})</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b>  )</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b>df.lapply</b></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"2\"><b># end</b></font></div></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-ELbGxkreojw/ViEaXcjLreI/AAAAAAAAJ7s/9ZA690XxfD8/s1600/%25E6%25AC%2584%25E9%2581%25BA%25E6%25BC%258F%25E5%2580%25BC%25E5%25A1%25AB%25E6%25BB%25BF%25E5%25B9%25B3%25E5%259D%2587%25E5%2580%25BC.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-ELbGxkreojw/ViEaXcjLreI/AAAAAAAAJ7s/9ZA690XxfD8/s1600/%2525E6%2525AC%252584%2525E9%252581%2525BA%2525E6%2525BC%25258F%2525E5%252580%2525BC%2525E5%2525A1%2525AB%2525E6%2525BB%2525BF%2525E5%2525B9%2525B3%2525E5%25259D%252587%2525E5%252580%2525BC.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238170914000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0DZt21FTDAYW6vX0LJfD9I\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-ELbGxkreojw/ViEaXcjLreI/AAAAAAAAJ7s/9ZA690XxfD8/s400/%25E6%25AC%2584%25E9%2581%25BA%25E6%25BC%258F%25E5%2580%25BC%25E5%25A1%25AB%25E6%25BB%25BF%25E5%25B9%25B3%25E5%259D%2587%25E5%2580%25BC.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"301\" height=\"400\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br>Tsai Lun於 2015年10月16日星期五 UTC+8下午9時17分02秒寫道：</div></div>"
